    <title>发刊词：关于欲望和屁</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6627aff8200abebe6ec5b72c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6627aff8200abebe6ec5b72c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 23 Apr 2024 12:56:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是《屁极泰来》的第0期，作为栏目的预告，主要跟大家做个简单的自我介绍，为什么要做播客，我和播客的前世今生，以及栏目名的灵感从何而来。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【本期内容】</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:18</a> 快速简单的自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a> 从0到1是目前最有经验的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> 关于三年前开始的播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a> 播客只需要一个感官</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="151">02:31</a> 之前为什么没坚持下来做播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="162">02:42</a> 我不能面对渴望被关注的欲望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">03:33</a> 接受自己的不完美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">03:49</a> 渴望与世界链接</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="248">04:08</a> 屁极泰来的灵感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="299">04:59</a> 节目定位来了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> 小小的郑重声明</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【泰来后记】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>未来节目里会聊到不限于职业、转型、跨行、生活、爱情、创伤、创业、金钱、遗憾、快乐、成功、失败......无论聊到什么内容，无论是否认可或喜欢，听听就好。若对你有些启发，很开心，没有就哈哈一笑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>好听就是香屁，不好听就是屁，管它什么都是屁。</span></p><span></span><p><span>屁友交流：pijitailai0422（备注播客）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：@Hi泰来</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【节目推荐】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>播客《屁极泰来》目前已上线至小宇宙App、喜马拉雅App、苹果播客、Spotify、网易云音乐、QQ音乐、豆瓣播客等平台，欢迎大家收听、订阅，如有任何问题或反馈，欢迎评论留言或邮件告知至：hitailai@outlook.com</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu1tVMQt-TyQJPmosyNXj7x2c4eP.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
